# 1.11 Advantages

* Low Cost
* Easy Installation
* Portable
* Wireless Monitoring
* Fast Gas Detection
* Real-Time Notifications
* Easy Maintenance
* Expandable for Future Enhancements

---

# 1.12 Limitations

* MQ2 cannot identify the exact type of gas.
* Sensor requires a warm-up period before accurate readings.
* Wi-Fi is required for remote monitoring.
* Threshold values must be calibrated for different environments.

---

