---

# 1.14 Conclusion

The Smart Gas Leakage Detection and Alert System successfully detects combustible gases using the MQ2 sensor and alerts users through LEDs, a buzzer, and the Blynk IoT platform. The project demonstrates the practical application of IoT in improving public safety. It is affordable, reliable, and can be enhanced further with cloud services, automatic valve control, and emergency communication features.
